    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d303">

                <pb facs="0412" n="340" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg340"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 871/44–48.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Moses to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-08-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 11, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 16—Greek series.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Turkish Government, on Friday, August
                    6, sent its formulated demands (copy inclosed) to its minister here, who at once
                    laid them before the Greek minister for foreign affairs.</p>
                <p>I inclose herewith copy of the Greek reply.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George H. Moses.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d303-a1.xml" xpointer="d303-a1"/>
